<font face="Segoe UI" size="44">Madamada shiranai dokidoki wakuwaku</font>

456
00:23:16,830 --> 00:23:21,040
<font face="Segoe UI" size="44">Takusan deaechau ne</font>

457
00:23:21,040 --> 00:23:22,380
<font face="Segoe UI" size="44">One, two, three! One, two, three!</font>

458
00:23:22,380 --> 00:23:25,250
<font face="Segoe UI" size="44">Saa, heart o kasanete</font>

459
