<font face="Segoe UI" size="44">Unmei mo sekai mo kawaridasu</font>

462
00:23:33,040 --> 00:23:36,460
<font face="Segoe UI" size="44">Tokimeki waltz de shall we dance?</font>

463
00:23:37,460 --> 00:23:39,250
<font face="Segoe UI" size="44">Jinsei wa ichido kiri?</font>

464
00:23:39,250 --> 00:23:41,290
<font face="Segoe UI" size="44">Nara ajiwai tsukusanakya</font>

